{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 8222108609062434954,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Container Isolation Internals",
      "source_hash": 5519562009275711485,
      "context_hash": 6575611020838880995,
      "translation": "컨테이너 격리 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878167Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How Docker, Kubernetes, and container runtimes use namespaces and cgroups",
      "source_hash": 9189125452569807813,
      "context_hash": 8583112602968913900,
      "translation": "Docker, Kubernetes 및 컨테이너 런타임이 네임스페이스와 cgroup을 사용하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Kubernetes": "Kubernetes",
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "container runtime": "컨테이너 런타임",
        "namespace": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878167Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What a container is, kernel-side",
      "source_hash": 138313971522945824,
      "context_hash": 11063908283047016214,
      "translation": "커널 관점에서 본 컨테이너",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878168Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A container is a process (or process tree) that:",
      "source_hash": 15079829248097398985,
      "context_hash": 2821839611513486429,
      "translation": "컨테이너는 다음과 같은 프로세스(또는 프로세스 트리)입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878168Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Lives in a set of **namespaces** (isolated view of system resources)",
      "source_hash": 10792019815041470119,
      "context_hash": 4259158743298165480,
      "translation": "일련의 **네임스페이스**(시스템 자원에 대한 격리된 뷰) 안에 존재합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "namespace": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878168Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Is governed by a **cgroup** (resource limits)",
      "source_hash": 11219336555718324624,
      "context_hash": 11687388656824617046,
      "translation": "**cgroup**(자원 제한)의 통제를 받습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878168Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Has a **filesystem root** (via mount namespace + chroot/pivot_root)",
      "source_hash": 17299026451730120265,
      "context_hash": 3044065067899697832,
      "translation": "**파일시스템 루트**(mount 네임스페이스 + chroot/pivot_root를 통해)를 가집니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "namespace": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Is optionally restricted by **seccomp** (syscall filtering) and **LSM** (AppArmor/SELinux)",
      "source_hash": 3781594392469956531,
      "context_hash": 6499154899194000862,
      "translation": "선택적으로 **seccomp**(시스템 콜 필터링)와 **LSM**(AppArmor/SELinux)에 의해 제한됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SELinux": "SELinux",
        "seccomp": "seccomp",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "There is no \"container\" kernel object — it's a combination of existing primitives.",
      "source_hash": 16603987515046548477,
      "context_hash": 16187549578952284305,
      "translation": "\"컨테이너\"라는 커널 객체는 존재하지 않습니다 — 컨테이너는 기존 프리미티브들의 조합입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel object": "커널 객체"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Container creation sequence",
      "source_hash": 14602210698328124532,
      "context_hash": 3260846483167948941,
      "translation": "컨테이너 생성 순서",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This is what `docker run` or `runc` does at the kernel level:",
      "source_hash": 846049287585133020,
      "context_hash": 4223498314947389560,
      "translation": "다음은 `docker run` 또는 `runc`가 커널 수준에서 수행하는 작업입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "pivot_root: switching filesystem root",
      "source_hash": 6528367418770654669,
      "context_hash": 18261314073777756496,
      "translation": "pivot_root: 파일시스템 루트 전환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Containers use `pivot_root` (not just `chroot`) to fully isolate the filesystem:",
      "source_hash": 12668794640438362532,
      "context_hash": 4064958074085428744,
      "translation": "컨테이너는 파일시스템을 완전히 격리하기 위해 (`chroot`만이 아니라) `pivot_root`를 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878169Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Network setup: veth pairs",
      "source_hash": 11468196348160295263,
      "context_hash": 15612200462447010799,
      "translation": "네트워크 설정: veth 쌍",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878170Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Container networking uses virtual ethernet pairs:",
      "source_hash": 17184093011306306385,
      "context_hash": 3626665936013041679,
      "translation": "컨테이너 네트워킹은 가상 이더넷 쌍을 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878170Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Cgroup namespace: container's view of cgroups",
      "source_hash": 4670749406221022789,
      "context_hash": 12359489521556617569,
      "translation": "cgroup 네임스페이스: 컨테이너가 보는 cgroup",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "cgroups": "cgroup",
        "namespace": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878170Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Without a cgroup namespace, a container would see the full host cgroup hierarchy.",
      "source_hash": 6499376905204078732,
      "context_hash": 1680704317144007538,
      "translation": "cgroup 네임스페이스가 없으면 컨테이너는 호스트의 cgroup 계층 구조 전체를 보게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "host": "호스트",
        "namespace": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878170Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "With `CLONE_NEWCGROUP`:",
      "source_hash": 8407288843820264931,
      "context_hash": 10882272796962575757,
      "translation": "`CLONE_NEWCGROUP`를 사용하면 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878170Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The cgroup namespace makes the container's cgroup appear as root, so `systemd` in a container doesn't see the host hierarchy.",
      "source_hash": 4250717110953817732,
      "context_hash": 5031186256318907567,
      "translation": "cgroup 네임스페이스는 컨테이너의 cgroup을 루트처럼 보이게 하므로, 컨테이너 안의 `systemd`는 호스트 계층 구조를 보지 못합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "host": "호스트",
        "namespace": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878170Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "User namespace: rootless containers",
      "source_hash": 7617452186477710139,
      "context_hash": 7213400592060488024,
      "translation": "사용자 네임스페이스: rootless 컨테이너",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "user namespace": "사용자 네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Rootless containers (Docker rootless, Podman) run entirely as unprivileged users:",
      "source_hash": 2647036612939355633,
      "context_hash": 12656679802406173100,
      "translation": "rootless 컨테이너(Docker rootless, Podman)는 전적으로 비특권 사용자로 실행됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The user namespace also enables unprivileged namespace creation for all other types.",
      "source_hash": 13348686782312567965,
      "context_hash": 3274914151606185696,
      "translation": "사용자 네임스페이스는 또한 다른 모든 유형의 네임스페이스를 비특권 상태로 생성할 수 있게 해 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "namespace": "네임스페이스",
        "user namespace": "사용자 네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "User namespaces were made fully functional for unprivileged users in Linux 3.9 [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/532593/).",
      "source_hash": 14366891725621786955,
      "context_hash": 3681485926491867610,
      "translation": "사용자 네임스페이스는 Linux 3.9에서 비특권 사용자도 완전히 사용할 수 있게 되었습니다 [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/532593/).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "user namespace": "사용자 네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "seccomp: syscall filtering",
      "source_hash": 6243387059261965137,
      "context_hash": 7007894782370351434,
      "translation": "seccomp: 시스템 콜 필터링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "seccomp": "seccomp",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Seccomp restricts which syscalls a container can make:",
      "source_hash": 13946530110598278353,
      "context_hash": 16744806669185549431,
      "translation": "seccomp는 컨테이너가 호출할 수 있는 시스템 콜을 제한합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "seccomp": "seccomp",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Docker's default seccomp profile blocks ~40 syscalls (including `keyctl`, `kexec_load`, `perf_event_open`, `ptrace`, etc.).",
      "source_hash": 211322975839848223,
      "context_hash": 3312203214156576352,
      "translation": "Docker의 기본 seccomp 프로필은 약 40개의 시스템 콜(`keyctl`, `kexec_load`, `perf_event_open`, `ptrace` 등)을 차단합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "seccomp": "seccomp",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "OCI runtime spec",
      "source_hash": 2254736529779250366,
      "context_hash": 5116315185872887721,
      "translation": "OCI 런타임 명세",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Open Container Initiative (OCI) runtime spec defines what a container runtime (runc, crun, kata) must do.",
      "source_hash": 11248267954511470477,
      "context_hash": 15992275301598842113,
      "translation": "Open Container Initiative(OCI) 런타임 명세는 컨테이너 런타임(runc, crun, kata)이 수행해야 하는 작업을 정의합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "container runtime": "컨테이너 런타임"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The spec is a JSON file (`config.json`):",
      "source_hash": 8768936168539185996,
      "context_hash": 1610370804940007318,
      "translation": "이 명세는 JSON 파일(`config.json`)입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:37.878172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
